light/dark class-swap mechanism). The page shell reproduces the REAL
ancestor chain read from the real templates (header/nav, main, h1 "What-If
Analysis", the bg-white/dark:bg-gray-800 card, h2 "Spending plan", h3 "How
much can I spend?", and `<div id="spending-optimizer-results">` correctly
NESTED inside `<section id="spending-optimizer">` as it is in
spending_optimizer.html:107 — an early version of this harness had it as a
sibling by mistake, which triggered a spurious color-contrast violation
(black-on-dark, since `dark:text-gray-100` from the section wrapper wasn't
inherited); fixing the nesting to match the real template removed it,
