review", not a violation) in both runs is on the synthetic nav's
`bg-gradient-to-r` background — axe cannot compute contrast against a CSS
gradient automatically. This is my own harness's simplified nav markup
reproducing the site's real header (bg-gradient-to-r ... text-white), not
